{%- comment -%}
  SNH workout plan library (Round 18). One JSON source for the homepage quiz band (sections/snh-quiz-band) and the
  member app's Goals tab (snippets/snh-app-goals), read by assets/snh-app.js (SNHPlans.pick / SNHPlans.render).
  12 plans: goal (muscle · fat · endurance · health) × days (2-3 · 4 · 5-6); 2–3 day plans are written for beginners,
  4 and 5–6 day plans for intermediates; the JS adds a level tweak when the member's level differs, and a sport note.
  Matching (assets/snh-app.js planFor): goal first, then days, then level. A member's plan is the tag plan:<id>.
  Each day: d (day label), f (focus), x: [exercise, sets × reps, rest]. Edit here; WORKOUT-PLANS.md has the metaobject
  definition to move this into Shopify admin later.
{%- endcomment -%}
